WEBVTT

00:05:58.058 --> 00:06:00.198
že pred 2.000 leti.
(Smeh)

00:06:00.198 --> 00:06:02.312
To me ni nikoli prešinilo.

00:06:02.312 --> 00:06:06.183
Denimo, piramide v Gizi,

00:06:06.183 --> 00:06:08.111
ki smo jih obiskali leto pred tem,

00:06:08.111 --> 00:06:11.031
so resnično osupljive, solidna zasnova,

00:06:11.031 --> 00:06:13.486
a dajte meni neomejen proračun,

00:06:13.486 --> 00:06:17.483
20.000 do 40.000 delavcev 
in okrog 10 do 20 let

00:06:17.483 --> 00:06:21.099
za rezanje in premikanje 
kamnitih blokov prek podeželja,

00:06:21.099 --> 00:06:23.863
in tudi jaz vam zgradim piramide.

00:06:23.863 --> 00:06:26.666
A nobena mera gole sile

00:06:26.666 --> 00:06:29.708
vam ne ustvari kupole Panteona,

00:06:29.708 --> 00:06:32.727
ne takrat, ne danes.